    "title": "Rialto Juneteenth Jam 2026 Returns to Ferguson Park Celebrating Culture, Community, and Freedom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carl M. Dameron 180 ,\n12 hours ago Rialto Juneteenth Jam 2026 Returns to Ferguson Park Celebrating Culture, Community, and Freedom. Rialto, CA — The City of Rialto will once again come alive with culture, connection, and celebration as the Rialto Juneteenth Jam returns on Friday, June 19, 2026, from 3:00 PM to 9:00 PM at Ferguson Park. This community event pays tribute to Juneteenth by highlighting Black history, resilience, and excellence through food, music, film, sports, and art. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
